  "title": "Hibike! Euphonium 3",
  "justification": "AniDB specials S2-S7 \"Extra Episode #1 - Always Natural\" to \"#6 - To Tomorrow, Coda\" (2024-06-26 to 2024-11-27) are TVDB season 0 episodes 21-26 \"Sound! Euphonium 3: Extra Episodes: Always Natural / Cute Dolce / Steady Andante / Forward Largo / To You, Amoroso / To Tomorrow, Coda\" on the same dates. The other specials (S1 TV preview, S8 April Fool video, S9-S14 unused footage, S15-S27 behind-the-scenes cuts and S28 the final-episode pre-broadcast special) have no TVDB episode; before, S21, S22 and S24-S26 fell on the extra episodes and S28 on \"The Final Movie Part 1\". All of them are unmapped. TMDB 62564 season 0: E19 You can enjoy it now! \"Sound! Euphonium\" = S1 Ima kara demo Tanoshimeru!, E20 April Fools Video = S8, E21-E26 Extra Episode #1-#6 = S2-S7, E27-E32 Unused Movie Collection Vol 1-6 = S9-S14 (same 2024 dates). TMDB lists none of the making-of cuts S15-S27 or the live broadcast S28. With no TMDB row every special defaulted to TMDB S0E\u003cn\u003e.",
